    {
      "principle": "Mercy",
      "turn": 1,
      "quote": "If he is the sort of man who would rather prune than talk, a cup of tea might be more useful to you than a complaint.",
      "use": "stretched",
      "note": "It encourages a conciliatory response, but the principles favour repair where it helps, not minimizing or sidestepping a complaint."
